{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415035","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415035","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041503501:1":{"text":"嗯，蔬菜和草药你基本都认识，特殊的果实你也学过了……","source_cn":"嗯，蔬菜和草药你基本都认识，特殊的果实你也学过了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9614CCAA58EE41D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503502:1":{"text":"那么等这场雨下完，我们就出去采蘑菇吧！","source_cn":"那么等这场雨下完，我们就出去采蘑菇吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9010E2D35A7F3711","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503503:1":{"text":"蘑菇？菌类的确是很好的食材……","source_cn":"蘑菇？菌类的确是很好的食材……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB1B6D2D5C4F80A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503504:1":{"text":"对吧！达赫妮婆婆的蘑菇汤棒极了，我一个人能喝一锅！","source_cn":"对吧！达赫妮婆婆的蘑菇汤棒极了，我一个人能喝一锅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DE62357F5EF5A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503505:1":{"text":"来的路上我已经采了一些。","source_cn":"来的路上我已经采了一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FB1C7DA0F773D02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:104150350